          "items": [
            {
              "id": "clx8tc5xa00213b6cl2hvo2nt",
              "heading": "",
              "paragraph": "<div data-editor-id=\"7f5cf3fa-baf9-4455-ada4-a792f56d234c\"><p>The course introduction highlights the potential of Generative AI (GenAI) to revolutionize work in the public sector. Participants will learn to use GenAI as a powerful companion to assist in their work through hands-on activities and best practices. The importance of delivering value while maintaining public trust and safety is emphasized. </p></div>"
            }
          ],
